WEBVTT

00:02.360 --> 00:03.780
And that's it.

00:04.230 --> 00:04.910
MILKY SUCCUBUS

00:04.910 --> 00:09.570
Senior Okumura is helping me
make my cosrom.

00:09.570 --> 00:11.780
Cosplay? ROM?

00:11.780 --> 00:14.380
Doing a photo shoot with
such attire and selling it?

00:14.380 --> 00:15.870
And what's that "milky succubus"?

00:16.240 --> 00:18.460
I can't believe it...

00:18.460 --> 00:21.920
A-Aren't you embarrassed?

00:21.920 --> 00:25.090
Well, it's not that I'm not
embarrassed at all...

00:25.090 --> 00:26.450
Is that so?!

00:27.450 --> 00:30.550
But my passion for expressing
this love always wins!

00:30.960 --> 00:33.640
Her love for cosplay?
Expressing?

00:37.010 --> 00:42.470
Ah, so that's how it is!
That's a simple strategy!

00:42.470 --> 00:45.110
COMPLETELY UNDERSTAND

00:45.470 --> 00:48.400
I'm relieved that you're still
a creepy otaku, senior.

00:48.400 --> 00:49.700
What?

00:49.700 --> 00:51.500
Umm, Tachibana...

00:51.500 --> 00:54.490
You called me Liliel earlier...

00:55.300 --> 00:57.030
Do you like her?

00:57.030 --> 00:59.710
Would you like to cosplay with me?

00:59.710 --> 01:02.750
There's no way a popular
model like her would do it.

01:02.750 --> 01:03.920
- Don't be absurd.
- I'll do it.

01:04.330 --> 01:05.470
See? Just forge—

01:05.470 --> 01:06.250
What?!

01:06.980 --> 01:08.070
I'll do it.

01:09.030 --> 01:10.180
I will!

01:34.320 --> 01:41.410
2.5 DIMENSIONAL SEDUCTION

02:41.020 --> 02:46.020
LILI X MIRI

02:46.710 --> 02:48.110
Are you serious?!

02:48.490 --> 02:49.770
Of course I am.

02:50.390 --> 02:54.170
I'll do anything if there is a chance
to make senior like me.

02:54.570 --> 02:55.780
Besides...

02:56.450 --> 02:58.740
I can't leave him alone with this girl!

02:59.600 --> 03:00.870
Say, senior.

03:01.290 --> 03:03.120
Is there a girl you like right now?

03:03.520 --> 03:04.990
A girl I like?

03:06.150 --> 03:09.600
There was a pause in that question
that I used to ask him in the past.

03:09.600 --> 03:12.340
There's no mistake
if a creepy otaku like him

03:12.340 --> 03:13.880
who has zero experience in love

03:13.880 --> 03:18.080
could have seen her Liliel cosplay
equally as liking this girl.

03:18.080 --> 03:19.100
So...

03:19.650 --> 03:21.690
There's only one thing I can do now.

03:21.690 --> 03:24.690
I must make him fall in love
with my cosplay before Lilysa does!

03:25.120 --> 03:26.190
Then...

03:26.550 --> 03:29.700
I want you to cosplay as Miriella.

03:30.300 --> 03:32.650
Do you mean Liliel's demon friend?

03:32.650 --> 03:33.900
Not Liliel?

03:34.510 --> 03:36.220
- You still read that manga?
- I want to take a picture of her with my Liliel!

03:36.220 --> 03:37.110
- I want to take a picture of her with my Liliel!

03:40.160 --> 03:42.390
I want to cosplay as Liliel.

03:42.390 --> 03:45.000
Huh? But you'll definitely look
good cosplaying as Miriella.

03:47.820 --> 03:50.380
Senior loves Liliel, right?

03:50.380 --> 03:53.430
That's why I want to cosplay as Liliel.

03:54.000 --> 03:57.470
Why do you want to cosplay as Liliel
because senior loves her?

03:58.850 --> 04:03.040
I want to get his attention
by cosplaying as his favorite character!

04:03.040 --> 04:05.100
But I can't say that to her...

04:05.100 --> 04:05.810
I...

04:07.170 --> 04:09.400
I like Liliel too.

04:10.400 --> 04:11.650
A COMRADE!!

04:12.090 --> 04:13.850
I understand! She's yours!

04:13.850 --> 04:17.320
I'm going to go adjust my costume,
so try this on.

04:22.490 --> 04:24.220
I think I'll cosplay as Miriella.

04:24.220 --> 04:25.870
Eh? What happened?!

04:26.220 --> 04:29.040
Hey, senior! Do you like Miriella?!

04:29.040 --> 04:30.290
You need to ask?!

04:30.290 --> 04:32.080
MIRIELLA FAVORITE
She is a cutie who competes with Liliel

04:32.080 --> 04:34.050
MIRIELLA FAVORITE
as her rival, who tries to seduce Ashford!

04:34.050 --> 04:37.510
Her love is pure, even though she realizes
that Ashford won't return her affection!

04:37.510 --> 04:39.390
She also has a cute ass
and a slender body!

04:39.390 --> 04:43.740
- And for otakus, her little breasts are justice!
- But you'd say you'd never cheat on Liliel.

04:43.740 --> 04:45.310
Liliel is my waifu.

04:45.310 --> 04:46.810
And Miriella is my little sister!

04:46.810 --> 04:48.560
But I can't be your little sister!

04:48.560 --> 04:49.540
Huh?

04:49.540 --> 04:53.210
But I still have a chance because
he recognizes cute girls.

04:53.210 --> 04:54.510
Okay, Tachibana.

04:54.510 --> 04:57.410
I'll buy the materials today,
so let me take your measurements.

04:57.410 --> 04:59.220
Are you going to make it now?!

04:59.220 --> 05:01.160
Yes! All my costumes are handmade.

05:01.160 --> 05:02.070
- 30 cm for twill, 70 cm of stretch enamel,

05:02.070 --> 05:03.670
- W-Wait!
- 30 cm for twill, 70 cm of stretch enamel,

05:03.670 --> 05:04.970
- How long will it take?
- elastic tape, and black thread.

05:04.970 --> 05:06.620
- Am I going to wait for months?
- elastic tape, and black thread.

05:06.620 --> 05:07.980
You're right.

05:08.550 --> 05:10.790
I don't need fabric that much, then...

05:15.200 --> 05:17.630
I will make it overnight!

05:18.270 --> 05:19.610
Seriously...?

05:28.730 --> 05:31.610
Ah, good timing, Tachibana.

05:32.390 --> 05:35.730
Let me take some detailed
measurements around your bust.

05:36.060 --> 05:36.570
Who is she?

05:36.570 --> 05:39.230
Ah, she is Lilysa,
the one who cosplayed as Liliel yesterday.

05:39.230 --> 05:42.240
She stayed up all night and brought in
her sewing machine this morning.

05:42.240 --> 05:43.990
I got plenty of sleep in class,

05:43.990 --> 05:46.700
and my dark circles can be hidden
with concealer, so I'm fine.

05:47.060 --> 05:48.880
- Actually, I'm not sure if I should
- So she's the student in my class

05:48.880 --> 05:50.730
- put stitches on the chest part...
- who slept all the time?

05:50.730 --> 05:53.420
The manga and anime portray it differently.

05:53.420 --> 05:55.180
Does it really matter? I mean...

05:55.180 --> 05:56.500
It really matters!

05:56.500 --> 05:59.350
A single stitch can completely change
the three-dimensional effect.

05:59.350 --> 06:01.670
In the original work,
the seams are along the nipples,

06:01.670 --> 06:03.470
which is why the series has them.

06:03.470 --> 06:05.270
But that line was removed
from the anime.

06:05.270 --> 06:09.290
However, since the anime is in color,
it looks more detailed.

06:09.290 --> 06:10.430
So detailed...

06:10.770 --> 06:14.960
The author and fans
love that one line.

06:14.960 --> 06:17.320
So that no matter how you
look at it from any angle,

06:17.320 --> 06:20.860
it will have that shape
and line that everyone loves

06:20.860 --> 06:23.270
and look like the character they love.

06:23.270 --> 06:26.160
It's a game to see
how much I can replicate

06:26.800 --> 06:28.850
a 2D character in 3D form!

06:30.530 --> 06:33.660
But my passion for expressing
this love always wins!

06:34.390 --> 06:36.010
Cosplay, huh?

06:36.010 --> 06:38.380
I might've underestimated
this kind of hobby.

06:38.380 --> 06:40.090
It's done!

06:45.510 --> 06:47.360
Wait a minute!
Am I going to wear this?!

06:47.360 --> 06:49.390
It's Miriella's costume
after enlistment, huh?

06:49.390 --> 06:51.290
I tried to make the sexiest costume for you.

06:51.290 --> 06:52.480
Why?!

06:52.480 --> 06:55.250
This is more embarrassing
than being naked!

06:55.250 --> 06:57.560
And I'm not even supposed
to wear a swimsuit...

06:57.560 --> 07:00.020
And I'll change with this costume.

07:00.020 --> 07:02.280
This one is literally just strings!

07:02.670 --> 07:04.090
You're gonna wear that?!

07:04.090 --> 07:04.700
Yes!

07:05.280 --> 07:09.120
Liliel in this costume is really
dangerous for senior!

07:10.030 --> 07:12.020
I can't lose to her...

07:12.690 --> 07:15.790
I'll make senior fall in love
with me before Lilysa does!

07:16.870 --> 07:18.080
What cute undies!

07:18.080 --> 07:20.800
I didn't wear these to show you.

07:20.800 --> 07:23.130
Where did you buy that?
Looks expensive.

07:23.130 --> 07:25.510
It's not that expensive...

07:25.510 --> 07:28.300
Huh? What's wrong?

07:29.720 --> 07:30.830
W-What are you doing?

07:30.830 --> 07:33.390
I don't envy those melon-like lumps of fat!

07:33.390 --> 07:34.680
Eh?

07:35.090 --> 07:37.950
I've seen stuff like this
between girls in manga.

07:37.950 --> 07:38.950
So it's not that bad.

07:38.950 --> 07:41.860
That's disgusting.
Don't you have any friends?

07:43.020 --> 07:44.440
Huh? Is my guess right?

07:44.820 --> 07:48.160
Also, please don't call me Tachibana.

07:48.160 --> 07:49.980
Just call me Mikari.

07:51.040 --> 07:52.540
Mikari...

07:52.970 --> 07:53.860
Mikari!

07:53.860 --> 07:54.910
What?

07:54.910 --> 07:56.570
That's something a friend would say!

07:56.570 --> 07:57.390
- Don't call me when you have nothing to do.

07:57.390 --> 07:58.370
- So Lilysa doesn't have any friends...
- Don't call me when you have nothing to do.

07:58.370 --> 07:59.540
- So Lilysa doesn't have any friends...
- Okay, Mikari!

07:59.540 --> 08:01.000
Geez! You're so noisy!

08:01.420 --> 08:03.380
Then let's do make-up and get dressed!

08:04.300 --> 08:06.780
Use concealer to remove moles and such.

08:06.780 --> 08:08.470
Is there anything that bothers you?

08:08.470 --> 08:11.830
Eh? Ah, let me do that myself.

08:11.830 --> 08:15.360
Oh, Mikari,
it's on the inside of your thighs.

08:15.360 --> 08:17.830
What?! We don't take pictures
of that part, right?!

08:17.830 --> 08:19.540
If you want, we'll take the first shot.

08:19.540 --> 08:21.110
Seriously?! The first?!

08:21.110 --> 08:22.110
- There!
- Meow!

08:22.870 --> 08:24.210
Don't touch me out of the blue!

08:24.210 --> 08:25.390
You are just meowing...

08:25.390 --> 08:26.320
Shut up!

08:31.470 --> 08:33.780
Is it done?

08:33.780 --> 08:35.450
Do you see anything weird?

08:35.450 --> 08:36.620
It's perfect!

08:37.620 --> 08:39.580
I look like a different person...

08:39.580 --> 08:43.940
Is this really making senior notice me?

08:44.960 --> 08:48.380
But I know that being
my usual self does not work.

08:49.190 --> 08:50.430
I have to change.

09:00.990 --> 09:02.770
You can turn around, senior.

09:23.430 --> 09:24.790
Senior!

09:24.790 --> 09:26.350
A-Are you okay?!

09:28.000 --> 09:30.050
I just remembered my promise...

09:30.670 --> 09:33.730
You nailed it, Mikari!
You perfectly cosplayed as Miriella!

09:33.730 --> 09:34.720
Eh?

09:35.130 --> 09:39.480
This is the first time he looks
so happy when he sees me!

09:39.480 --> 09:42.310
Y-You look perfect too, Liliel.

09:42.770 --> 09:44.710
His gaze is focusing on Liliel!

09:44.710 --> 09:47.950
It can't be helped because
senior loves her, but...

09:47.950 --> 09:49.490
Even Miriella...

09:50.940 --> 09:55.200
Come to think of it, I don't like the manga
that senior is obsessed with,

09:55.200 --> 09:57.620
but for some reason
I don't dislike Miriella.

09:58.490 --> 10:01.760
She falls in love at first sight
with Ashford, who saved her,

10:01.760 --> 10:03.970
and tries to get his attention.

10:03.970 --> 10:07.110
Ashford already has a firm bond with Liliel,

10:07.110 --> 10:08.860
and Miriella's love doesn't pay off.

10:11.720 --> 10:13.950
Look at me!

10:13.950 --> 10:16.180
Eventually, she and Liliel
become best friends,

10:16.890 --> 10:19.620
but she still can't be honest
about her feelings.

10:22.330 --> 10:24.420
Miriella is just like me.

10:24.420 --> 10:26.170
And I can't even hate him.

10:30.900 --> 10:32.650
Look at me!

10:32.650 --> 10:35.280
It's a real Miriella!

10:35.280 --> 10:36.830
Thank you for your service, really!

10:36.830 --> 10:38.560
You've delivered Miriella's iconic line!

10:38.560 --> 10:39.170
What?

10:39.170 --> 10:41.040
- No, that wasn't my intention...
- Thank you so much!

10:41.540 --> 10:42.370
Anyway,

10:43.190 --> 10:46.460
senior is looking at me like that.

10:46.460 --> 10:49.730
S-Senior, you said that
you like Miriella's butt...

10:49.730 --> 10:51.840
Huh? W-Well, yeah!

10:55.510 --> 10:57.610
H-How is it?

10:58.290 --> 10:59.560
Do you like it?

11:00.240 --> 11:01.270
That pose...!

11:01.890 --> 11:03.230
You don't like it?

11:03.230 --> 11:06.070
Of course I like you!

11:06.070 --> 11:07.190
HE MEANS MIRIELLA

11:10.210 --> 11:14.660
I've been in love with him for 10 years!
10 years!

11:14.660 --> 11:15.610
IGNORING THAT HE MEANS MIRIELLA
And this is the first time

11:15.610 --> 11:17.150
IGNORING THAT HE MEANS MIRIELLA
he said that he liked me!

11:17.650 --> 11:19.030
I mean...

11:19.030 --> 11:21.520
Senior is too simple...

11:21.520 --> 11:23.790
What have I been doing
in these 10 years?

11:24.630 --> 11:27.460
I'm glad I'm doing cosplay right now.

11:27.460 --> 11:29.500
Thank you, Miriella!

11:29.930 --> 11:31.660
And Lilysa too, I guess.

11:32.960 --> 11:35.300
Then, let's do a photo shoot
for cosrom now!

11:35.300 --> 11:37.940
Are we really doing a photo shoot
with these outfits?

11:37.940 --> 11:38.670
Yes!

11:38.670 --> 11:41.210
I mean, I have a contract
with my model job.

11:41.210 --> 11:44.770
Well, if it's for senior,
I'll keep quiet for now.

11:45.850 --> 11:49.310
I'LL HEAL YOU!
Hmm? Huh? What?

11:50.660 --> 11:53.610
Am I going to do these?!

11:58.240 --> 12:00.490
Then we will start the photo shoot,

12:00.490 --> 12:03.930
but if you feel shy,
please don't force yourself, Mikari.

12:03.930 --> 12:06.900
Senior and I can always
do the photo shoot alone.

12:07.840 --> 12:10.190
Senior alone with Liliel...

12:12.450 --> 12:14.740
I-I'll do it!

12:14.740 --> 12:18.960
It's embarrassing, but it's even worse
if senior falls in love with Lilysa!

12:18.960 --> 12:20.830
Don't push yourself.

12:27.440 --> 12:30.850
F-For now, I shouldn't look
at them with pervy eyes!

12:30.850 --> 12:32.740
The danger level is twice as high!

12:32.740 --> 12:35.400
But I have a secret plan too!

12:36.210 --> 12:40.570
The man who keeps his feelings pure even when
Liliel and Miriella are closing in on him!

12:40.570 --> 12:41.570
That's right!

12:41.570 --> 12:44.810
I'm going to be Ashford myself!

12:45.620 --> 12:48.120
So let's do it! Liliel! Miriella!

12:48.500 --> 12:49.500
O-Okay!

12:49.500 --> 12:51.080
Senior is pumped up?!

12:51.080 --> 12:52.300
Then let's start with the pose.

12:52.300 --> 12:53.430
I'LL HEAL YOU!
Then let's start with the pose.

12:53.430 --> 12:55.900
This is one of the most erotic
interactions between them.

12:55.900 --> 12:58.320
Liliel recovers Miriella with
an infusion of magic power.

12:58.320 --> 13:00.800
Why do you have to touch
the boobs to heal her injuries?!

13:00.800 --> 13:02.830
L-Liliel already explained that, didn't she?

13:02.830 --> 13:04.420
Breasts are essentially mother's milk!

13:04.420 --> 13:07.350
It is a sacred part of the body
that gives life energy to a new life!

13:07.350 --> 13:08.960
They are channels for life's energy.

13:08.960 --> 13:10.440
Are you somewhat of a genius?

13:10.960 --> 13:13.620
Then, please excuse me.
I'll touch it.

13:13.620 --> 13:16.400
P-Please do it gently.

13:16.800 --> 13:21.110
Calm yourself, Okumura! Ashford has
no pervy feelings towards these girls!

13:21.820 --> 13:25.080
Senior is really excited right now!
The senior that I knew!

13:25.080 --> 13:27.790
I knew this plan would work!

13:29.030 --> 13:32.750
I-I can't hold it,
even though she does it gently!

13:34.690 --> 13:37.840
Y-You played that perfectly, Mikari!

13:37.840 --> 13:38.890
Huh?

13:38.890 --> 13:42.550
According to Liliel, the infusions induce
a certain amount of pleasure!

13:42.550 --> 13:44.350
What kind of explanation is that?!

13:44.350 --> 13:46.720
I got an awesome expression
from yours, Miriella!

13:46.720 --> 13:47.510
Huh?

13:49.310 --> 13:51.990
T-That wasn't my intention...

13:51.990 --> 13:54.770
Senior saw my expression just now...

13:54.770 --> 13:56.730
I mean, he captured it on camera!

13:56.730 --> 14:00.970
Now, please infuse your magic
power into me next, Mikari!

14:00.970 --> 14:01.700
What?

14:02.160 --> 14:05.440
Miriella will restore Liliel's magic
power in return for being healed.

14:05.440 --> 14:06.660
Cut it out.

14:07.460 --> 14:09.940
I just need to do the same
thing you did, right?

14:09.940 --> 14:11.120
Yes!

14:14.170 --> 14:16.180
Don't make that sexy moan!

14:16.180 --> 14:18.980
T-That's not it, Mikari!
She just showed the pleasure she felt!

14:18.980 --> 14:20.550
Huh? That was acting?

14:21.450 --> 14:23.420
That's fine, then...

14:30.890 --> 14:33.890
This is the real magic power infusion!

14:33.890 --> 14:38.400
How did you keep calm
when watching this, Ashford?

14:39.260 --> 14:40.820
Senior?!

14:40.820 --> 14:44.780
H-He is really down bad
for Liliel after all!

14:44.780 --> 14:48.370
Okay, give me another infusion!

14:48.370 --> 14:50.550
Huh? You want a re-shoot?

14:52.000 --> 14:53.250
Ah, don't pull it!

14:53.250 --> 14:54.180
What's wrong?

14:54.180 --> 14:56.250
I think our costumes
got tangled together.

14:56.250 --> 14:58.460
Could it be... This development...!

14:59.120 --> 15:02.100
Senior, please untangle us!

15:02.100 --> 15:05.300
I knew it, goddammit!

15:05.300 --> 15:08.660
It looks like her hand
is stuck on my chest.

15:08.660 --> 15:09.760
B-But...

15:10.330 --> 15:13.350
No way! Senior really did such a thing?!

15:13.350 --> 15:17.890
No, you can't!
Senior mustn't fondle Liliel's breast!

15:17.890 --> 15:19.670
But... But...!

15:20.020 --> 15:21.980
O-Okay...

15:22.940 --> 15:25.180
Just do it, senior!

15:25.180 --> 15:27.820
The costumes that Lilysa
made will be ruined!

15:28.810 --> 15:30.280
Mikari...

15:30.280 --> 15:32.240
I-I understand!

15:32.810 --> 15:35.170
I never thought this would happen again!

15:35.170 --> 15:37.780
Ugh! Don't think about anything else!

15:37.780 --> 15:41.270
If you're Ashford, you must help Liliel!

15:41.270 --> 15:44.670
Clear your mind and steady yourself.

15:47.130 --> 15:50.640
Oh my goodness!
It's so soft!

15:50.640 --> 15:52.720
Why are you crying, senior?!

15:53.140 --> 15:55.740
This is bad, Lilysa!
I might break it if I pull it!

15:55.740 --> 15:59.730
Then, if you unhook the hooks on the side,
it'll separate the front from the back!

15:59.730 --> 16:01.230
What? Wait...

16:01.230 --> 16:03.430
- Hooks on the side...
- Wait! If you unhook that part..!

16:09.160 --> 16:10.410
That's right...

16:10.770 --> 16:12.870
This plan had a weak point.

16:13.540 --> 16:17.330
Come to think of it,
Ashford dies sometimes, too.

16:19.710 --> 16:22.440
Senior!

16:26.260 --> 16:32.860
Mikari, so you're saying that Miriella
had already decided to hide her feelings

16:32.860 --> 16:35.540
for Master Ashford for the sake
of her friendship with Liliel?

16:35.540 --> 16:37.790
Of course. You can tell
if you read the manga.

16:37.790 --> 16:39.740
Y-You're right!

16:39.740 --> 16:43.690
You know Miriella's detailed
feelings very well, Mikari!

16:44.420 --> 16:47.600
But I'm sorry,
I didn't notice it until now.

16:47.600 --> 16:48.490
What?

16:48.490 --> 16:50.360
Mikari, you're...

16:50.360 --> 16:52.120
...still an otaku!

16:53.370 --> 16:55.810
But I've never done anything
close to an otaku!

16:55.810 --> 16:59.280
I thought you had already
forgotten about manga.

16:59.280 --> 17:03.090
That's why I was so happy to be able
to talk about this stuff with you again.

17:04.180 --> 17:05.300
I see!

17:06.010 --> 17:10.220
Maybe I've been so focused
on wanting him to like me

17:10.220 --> 17:14.930
that I haven't tried to understand
what he likes.

17:16.700 --> 17:22.320
It wasn't because I looked like
Miriella that made him happy.

17:22.320 --> 17:26.280
It was because he could share
his favorite manga with me.

17:26.990 --> 17:32.380
Cosplay took me to a world
that senior loved.

17:42.190 --> 17:45.930
A-Anyway, thank you for your help, Mikari.

17:45.930 --> 17:48.090
I can make the best cosrom, thanks to you.

17:48.090 --> 17:50.930
I'm sorry, but you can't use my picture.

17:50.930 --> 17:52.800
I have a model contract in my office.

17:52.800 --> 17:53.820
What?!

17:53.820 --> 17:55.330
I'm sorry, I forgot to tell you.

17:55.330 --> 17:57.360
So we're just going to keep them?!

17:57.360 --> 18:00.560
Of course. She is a professional
and popular model.

18:00.560 --> 18:01.890
Just give it up.

18:02.590 --> 18:06.490
Well, now that I know
what cosplay is about,

18:06.490 --> 18:08.490
I wouldn't mind doing it again someday.

18:08.490 --> 18:13.490
Really? It was my first time cosplaying
with someone else, so I had such a blast!

18:16.230 --> 18:17.370
Mikari?

18:17.370 --> 18:20.450
I'll take my time.
Because...

18:20.850 --> 18:24.940
Senior is 3D, I can make
him fall in love with me.

18:24.940 --> 18:26.210
It's nothing.

18:32.560 --> 18:36.070
What was that feeling
I had just now?

18:37.460 --> 18:39.050
Today was such a blast.

18:39.050 --> 18:41.640
It's a shame that we can't include
her photos for cosrom.

18:42.020 --> 18:44.870
Senior, about the cosrom,

18:45.820 --> 18:50.070
actually, I've already saved enough material
for one ROM that I had planned.

18:50.070 --> 18:51.070
That's good!

18:51.590 --> 18:54.780
Now it's time to make it
and go to the event!

18:54.780 --> 18:56.430
It's time, huh?

18:56.430 --> 18:59.870
The problem is that the event
I've already applied for is next month.

18:59.870 --> 19:02.030
It's during the Golden Week holidays.

19:02.030 --> 19:04.370
That's only a little over a week away.

19:04.370 --> 19:06.800
I'll make it in time somehow.

19:06.800 --> 19:07.980
Make it in time?

19:07.980 --> 19:10.290
Editing will take a lot of work.

19:10.290 --> 19:13.590
Processing the photos
and creating a web page too.

19:13.590 --> 19:15.490
Hmm, if I try to learn editing...

19:15.490 --> 19:19.570
Oh, I can do the editing by myself,
so you don't need to!

19:19.840 --> 19:21.180
I said I'd help you, didn't I?

19:21.180 --> 19:25.560
But it's a lot of work
and way more boring than shooting.

19:25.560 --> 19:27.260
I can't drag you into it...

19:27.260 --> 19:31.730
Lilysa... It wouldn't be called "helping"
when you think you can do it.

19:32.150 --> 19:36.610
And I promised I'd help you
every step of the way.

19:37.220 --> 19:38.820
Senpai...

19:38.820 --> 19:42.790
B-But... I can't do anything
to repay the favor.

19:43.180 --> 19:46.150
Just seeing you come to the club,
it's been so fun every day.

19:46.150 --> 19:47.750
That's plenty for me.

19:49.920 --> 19:51.960
I-I understand!

19:51.960 --> 19:54.320
Then, let's do it together.

20:02.380 --> 20:06.190
We can easily stay all night
if we turn off the lights

20:06.190 --> 20:07.950
around 10 p.m. and 2 a.m.

20:07.950 --> 20:09.980
It makes my heart race.

20:10.490 --> 20:12.230
Well, let's get started, shall we?

20:12.230 --> 20:13.360
Y-Yes.

20:14.050 --> 20:16.950
First, we choose the photos we'll use.

20:16.950 --> 20:19.180
We'll use the ROM concept.

20:19.180 --> 20:21.830
The best of each pose will be
imported into the apps,

20:22.190 --> 20:25.910
and we'll process them with
color correction and retouching.

20:26.290 --> 20:29.290
And we'll repeat it on all 500 photos.

20:29.290 --> 20:31.000
500?!

20:31.570 --> 20:33.030
A-Anyway, let's do it.

20:33.030 --> 20:33.840
Yes!

20:37.420 --> 20:40.030
This is more time-consuming
than I thought.

20:40.030 --> 20:41.340
That's right.

20:41.340 --> 20:45.100
If it takes 5 minutes per photo,
processing 500 of them will take...

20:45.100 --> 20:46.170
By the way, senior...

20:46.170 --> 20:48.980
Don't give up.
It'll take 41 hours and 40 minutes.

20:50.020 --> 20:52.220
Maybe I won't make it in time!

20:52.220 --> 20:53.630
Don't say that, Lilysa.

20:53.630 --> 20:56.220
I should have started earlier...

20:56.220 --> 20:57.550
Even for the next event...

20:57.550 --> 20:59.430
There's no end if you keep complaining!

20:59.430 --> 21:00.070
But...!

21:00.070 --> 21:01.320
Don't be so timid!

21:05.050 --> 21:07.200
We can do it if we do it together!

21:12.190 --> 21:13.370
Is anyone there?!

21:13.370 --> 21:14.320
Oh, crap!

21:16.800 --> 21:18.010
Who's there!

21:18.010 --> 21:20.740
If push comes to shove,
I'll go out and apologize.

21:20.740 --> 21:21.590
You go hide!

21:21.590 --> 21:22.460
But...

21:22.460 --> 21:25.470
It's okay. I'll protect you.

21:26.110 --> 21:29.030
But, senior... You're too close!

21:32.150 --> 21:33.360
I don't know.

21:34.040 --> 21:36.320
Well, whatever.

21:39.610 --> 21:41.110
He's gone.

21:42.670 --> 21:44.790
Okay, let's continue, Lilysa.

22:06.630 --> 22:09.410
It's okay. I'll protect you.

22:10.970 --> 22:13.390
That's right. Senior is here.

22:18.220 --> 22:19.730
I'm not alone.

22:20.210 --> 22:22.980
We're making the best cosrom together!

23:55.040 --> 24:01.120
LET'S GO, THE FIRST EVENT!
